  "description": "*“If I can’t have you, no one can.”* \n\nHestia killed her beloved brother Ian with her own two hands. Three months later, he reappears in front of her seemingly unharmed; however, he has seemingly lost all his memories and become an almost completely different person. Everyone in the kingdom welcomes him back with open arms, but only Hestia suspects some foul play at work. Has her brother really changed? Or Ian not who he seems? \n\n(Source: Lehzin US)",
